  "body": "This change adds governed Stage1 LLM assistance to the existing gateway and canonical application flow. Admins manage multiple Provider instances and Models; ordinary users request AUTO/SINGLE/MULTI_MODEL only from the backend eligible catalog. Invocation policy, ModelUsagePolicy, current authorization and immutable snapshot pins govern every call. Document output remains Candidate input through existing SourceTrace/resolution; insufficient-evidence query expansion retains the exact Knowledge Scope. LLM output never owns formal legal decisions.\n\nBaseline: `efda0955342de8d1ea36aa0f754d63c9b421fec8` (`v3.6-m2d-pass`). Final tested PR/runner checkout: `d74bca4b61178637f24302d8b1fa6baa4f05ea59`. Original ancestry preserved. Keep Draft; no merge requested.\n\nOwnership: existing LLM contracts/application/gateway/control plane, minimal provider/deployment/snapshot persistence extensions, canonical Admin/Intake UI and generated contracts, tests/CI/delivery evidence. One Provider/Model registry, gateway, graph, runtime and checkpoint authority remain. Frozen legal owners and M2-B temporal/M2-D review contracts are preserved. Finite approved source overlay contains102 exact paths with source hashes.\n\nMigration: `0016_phase1kb_multi_provider_llm_governance`, linear parent0015. Frozen0001\u20130015 byte identity PASS. Real PostgreSQL fresh/head, exact0015 upgrade, schema equivalence, empty downgrade/re-upgrade and authoritative-pin transactional downgrade refusal PASS.\n\nMeasured final closure:\n\n- Backend844 PASS, including81 new Phase1KB tests; zero failed/errors/skipped/deselected; Phase1B\u2013J coverage retained.\n- Architecture269/269 PASS (242 existing +27); Runtime25/25 PASS.\n- Frontend130 PASS; typecheck/lint/build/i18n PASS.\n- Browser57/57 PASS: KB Admin/User6, M2-D/C/B/A/M1 three each, original M036. zh-CN/zh-HK/en-US; retries0.\n- Secret boundary, health/connection/discovery/model tests, eligibility, AUTO/SINGLE/MULTI, snapshot pins, genuine document candidates, same-scope query expansion and formal-owner separation PASS.\n\nProvider acceptance uses protocol-realistic local HTTP A(A1/A2)/B(B1/B2) through canonical HTTP/OpenAI-compatible adapters, including chat/structured output/embedding. OpenAI/GPT, DeepSeek, Qwen, GLM and other compatible presets PASS this protocol acceptance. Optional paid Internet acceptance (`REAL_LLM_E2E=1`) was not executed; no live paid-endpoint claim. Secrets remain write-only protected SecretStorePort references and never enter normal metadata, responses, audit, checkpoint, snapshots or evidence.\n\nAll eight exact-head workflows SUCCESS:\n\n- [M1 Intake Analysis Alpha \u2014 37876459381](https://github.com/bensuen0831/crossborder-compliance-agent/actions/runs/37876459381): SUCCESS\n- [M2C Formal Result Workspace \u2014 37876459323](https://github.com/bensuen0831/crossborder-compliance-agent/actions/runs/37876459323): SUCCESS\n- [M2B Production Document Integration \u2014 37876459340](https://github.com/bensuen0831/crossborder-compliance-agent/actions/runs/37876459340): SUCCESS\n- [M0 Knowledge & Evidence Preview \u2014 37876459359](https://github.com/bensuen0831/crossborder-compliance-agent/actions/runs/37876459359): SUCCESS\n- [M2A Production Intake \u2014 37876459346](https://github.com/bensuen0831/crossborder-compliance-agent/actions/runs/37876459346): SUCCESS\n- [M2D Governed Human Review \u2014 37876459369](https://github.com/bensuen0831/crossborder-compliance-agent/actions/runs/37876459369): SUCCESS\n- [phase1a-runtime-smoke \u2014 37876459370](https://github.com/bensuen0831/crossborder-compliance-agent/actions/runs/37876459370): SUCCESS\n- [Phase1KB Multi-provider LLM Governance \u2014 37876459348](https://github.com/bensuen0831/crossborder-compliance-agent/actions/runs/37876459348): SUCCESS\n\nDedicated measured artifacts assert `tested_pr_head_sha == runner_checkout_sha == final_sha` at the final head. Earlier superseded CI and invalidated local runs are not final evidence.\n\nSanitized immutable [closure report](https://github.com/bensuen0831/crossborder-compliance-agent/blob/04eb738/docs/phase1kb/Phase1KB_final_exact_head_validation.md) and [machine evidence](https://github.com/bensuen0831/crossborder-compliance-agent/blob/04eb738/evidence/phase1kb/final_exact_head_validation.json) live on independent evidence branch `evidence/phase1kb-closure-d74bca4`; they do not advance this tested PR head.\n\nPHASE1K-B = PASS. M2-E EXTERNAL AGENT API ENTRY = ALLOWED (contract handoff only). STAGE1 FULL E2E ENTRY = BLOCKED UNTIL M2-E MAIN CLOSURE. Stage2 NOT STARTED. No M2-E production endpoints, Stage2 generation, production auth redesign or next-phase implementation. Blockers: NONE.\n",
